# 41. Superseded 정책

두 가지 선택지가 있다.

## 선택안 A. `noindex`

```ts
function supersededDecision():
  PublicationDecision {
  return {
    render: true,

    index: false,
    follow: true,

    includeInSearch: false,
    includeInSitemap: false,
    includeInRss: false,
    includeInTopicLists: false,

    canBeFeatured: false,
    adsEligible: false,

    searchRankMultiplier: 0,
  };
